# Waiver block 1 of 1 — gosu / embedded Go stdlib 1.24.6 (usr/local/bin/gosu)
# Reachability evidence: gosu (tianon/gosu) imports only
#   os, os/exec, runtime, syscall, github.com/moby/sys/user, golang.org/x/sys/unix.
# Go links only reachable code, so stdlib packages absent from that import set
# are not present in the binary; the scanner flags the toolchain version.
# Per-CVE reasoning below; no blanket "no network" claim.
# ============================================================================
# CVE-2025-68121 crypto/tls session resumption - gosu never imports crypto/tls and opens no TLS session
# CVE-2025-61726 net/url query-parameter limit - gosu imports no net/url and parses no URLs
# CVE-2025-61729 crypto/x509 HostnameError.Error - gosu imports no crypto/x509
# CVE-2026-25679 net/url host/authority validation - gosu imports no net/url
# CVE-2026-27145 crypto/x509 VerifyHostname - gosu imports no crypto/x509
# CVE-2026-32280 crypto/x509 chain building limits - gosu imports no crypto/x509
# CVE-2026-32281 crypto/x509 policy chains - gosu imports no crypto/x509
# CVE-2026-32283 crypto/tls key update - gosu imports no crypto/tls
# CVE-2026-33811 net LookupCNAME cgo resolver - gosu imports no net and performs no DNS lookups
# CVE-2026-33814 net/http HTTP/2 SETTINGS transport - gosu imports no net/http
# CVE-2026-33818 encoding/asn1 Unmarshal recursion - gosu imports no encoding/asn1
# CVE-2026-39820 net/mail ParseAddress/ParseAddressList/ParseDate - gosu imports no net/mail
# CVE-2026-39821 Punycode ToASCII/ToUnicode label validation - gosu performs no domain-label handling
# CVE-2026-39822 os.Root trailing-slash symlink escape - gosu imports os but never constructs os.Root
# CVE-2026-39836 net Dial/LookupPort Windows panic - gosu imports no net; image is linux-only
# CVE-2026-42499 net/mail consumePhrase DoS - gosu imports no net/mail
# CVE-2026-42504 MIME header encoded-word decoding - gosu imports no mime/textproto
# CVE-2026-56853 net/http unencrypted HTTP/2 server - gosu imports no net/http
# CVE-2026-56858 net/url path escaping - gosu imports no net/url
# CVE-2026-56859 encoding/xml DecodeElement depth - gosu imports no encoding/xml
# CVE-2026-56860 os.Root '..' path resolution - gosu imports os but never constructs os.Root
# CVE-2026-56862 crypto/tls handshake state - gosu imports no crypto/tls
# CVE-2026-78667 net/http Range header DoS - gosu imports no net/http
# CVE-2026-78669 net/http HTTP/2 SETTINGS frames DoS - gosu imports no net/http
